<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Focus Capsule</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png" type="image/png" />
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f4efe7;
        --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        --line: rgba(24, 39, 56, 0.12);
        --text: #182738;
        --muted: rgba(24, 39, 56, 0.66);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Avenir Next", "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 170, 119, 0.34), transparent 24%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(104, 168, 255, 0.28), transparent 28%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #fbf8f3, #ebe4d8 70%);
      }

      .page {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 32px 24px 56px;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(24, 39, 56, 0.08);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
        gap: 22px;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .icon {
        width: 120px;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        border-radius: 30px;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 38% 34%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86), transparent 18%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, #ffbb86, #ff7cab 48%, #5e72ff);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(68, 60, 80, 0.18);
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
        line-height: 0.95;
      }

      .subtitle {
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        max-width: 560px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .actions a {
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .actions a:first-child {
        background: #182738;
        color: white;
      }

      .actions a:last-child {
        background: rgba(24, 39, 56, 0.08);
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
        grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 22px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      }

      .card h2 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .card p,
      .card li {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .card ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 18px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .shot {
        margin-top: 18px;
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #16212f, #0f1724);
        color: #eef6ff;
      }

      .shot__top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .shot__dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .shot__dots span {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      }

      .shot__screen {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      }

      .shot__screen div {
        min-height: 120px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .meta {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .meta strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .meta span {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .hero,
        .grid,
        .shot__screen {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <span class="badge">Orbit Store Preview</span>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="icon"></div>
        <div>
          <h1>Focus Capsule</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">
            一个把计时器、待办入口和每日复盘压缩到单一启动界面的效率工具。这里用本地页面模拟 App Store 详情页，方便直接嵌进桌面窗口里。
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a href="#">View Case Study</a>
            <a href="#">Product Notes</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h2>核心卖点</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>把用户每天最常做的三件事压缩进一个视图，减少切换成本。</li>
            <li>用沉浸式色块和节奏反馈，强化“已经开始”的心理暗示。</li>
            <li>支持回顾卡片，方便展示你如何把产品能力落成完整方案。</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="shot">
            <div class="shot__top">
              <strong>App Preview</strong>
              <div class="shot__dots">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="shot__screen">
              <div></div>
              <div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="meta">
          <article class="card">
            <span>Category</span>
            <strong>Productivity</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span>Release Shape</span>
            <strong>Case + Demo + Notes</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span>Why it exists</span>
            <strong>适合承接一个完整项目页</strong>
          </article>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
